[thin] Specified cup-floor section: Derek selected the 2.38 mm vertical casing while retaining the existing 2 mm floors, pocket heights and passage datums. The floor is the stack's 2.0 mm floor section above its 0.15 mm seat clearance, which leaves 2.05 mm under the B-fill pockets. The straight water and soda guides retain the surrounding floor stock.
alternatives: A 3 mm floor changes the retained cup-floor and B-fill pocket stack; preserving those interfaces requires changing the cup height or the cap face.
